{"id":57337,"date":"2026-08-06T10:43:26","date_gmt":"2026-08-06T09:43:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-entre-pontes-tavira\/"},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:51:33","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:51:33","slug":"corrida-entre-pontes-tavira","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-entre-pontes-tavira\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Entre Pontes Tavira 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Entre Pontes Tavira 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida Entre Pontes Tavira 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 um dos eventos mais emblem\u00e1ticos do atletismo de estrada no sotavento algarvio, realizando-se no domingo, <strong>20 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica cidade de <strong>Tavira<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Faro<\/strong>. Com partida e meta na <strong>Pra\u00e7a da Rep\u00fablica<\/strong>, a prova percorre as duas margens do Rio Gil\u00e3o num circuito din\u00e2mico e veloz de <strong>10.300 metros<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>Clube de Vela de Tavira<\/strong>, com o apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Tavira<\/strong> e a chancela t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Algarve (AAALG)<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o acolhe atletas federados e populares desde os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o (Sub-10 a Sub-18) at\u00e9 aos veteranos. A corrida principal conta com pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os primeiros cinco atletas da geral, meta volante ao km 4,3 e abastecimentos aos 5 km e na meta.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Setembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; 